{"id":"en_forest-bound-the-dragon-s-pet","title":"Forest Bound: The Dragon's Pet","titleEn":"Forest Bound: The Dragon's Pet","description":"Aurelia, a wood-elf with the rare ability to heal any wound, is the sole remedy for the dragon-blood curse afflicting Kain. Their relationship begins as a contract, but she will not accept being reduced to an instrument of his cure, so she breaks free and flees. While hostile forces close in on her, Kain's fixation on Aurelia only intensifies. Over time, she transforms from a captive into a woman who commands her own fate, and the two of them confront the barriers separating their respective worlds. Audiences can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/forest-bound-the-dragons-pet/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/forest-bound-the-dragons-pet/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Contract Lovers","Enemies to Lovers","Fantasy","Fantasy Romance","Female","Hate to Love"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci7wa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_forest-bound-the-dragon-s-pet_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci7wa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forest-bound-the-dragon-s-pet_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci7wa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forest-bound-the-dragon-s-pet_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci7wa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forest-bound-the-dragon-s-pet_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sou